### 1. 添加到购物车
POST http://localhost:8080/api/cart/user/2
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "dishId": 5,
  "quantity": 2,
  "specification": "大份",
  "note": "不要葱",
  "selected": true
}

### 2. 获取购物车
GET http://localhost:8080/api/cart/user/2

### 3. 获取购物车统计
GET http://localhost:8080/api/cart/user/2/info

### 4. 更新购物车项数量
PUT http://localhost:8080/api/cart/1
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "dishId": 5,
  "quantity": 3
}

### 5. 更新选中状态
PATCH http://localhost:8080/api/cart/1/select?selected=false

### 6. 删除购物车项
DELETE http://localhost:8080/api/cart/1

### 7. 清空选中项
DELETE http://localhost:8080/api/cart/user/1/clear-selected

### 8. 清空购物车
DELETE http://localhost:8080/api/cart/user/1/clear